const fields=[['server','Server'],['application','Application'],['component','Application component'],['status','Status'],['criticality','Criticality'],['ha','High Availability ?'],['secondary','Secondary node'],['group','Group'],['owner','Infra Owner'],['installed','Date Install Server'],['asset','Asset'],['location','Location'],['rack','Rack'],['rackUnit','RackUnit'],['cluster','Enclosure/Vmware Cluster/Cluster/F5 vs'],['bay','Enclosure Bay']];
const KEY='bsk-cmdb-workspace-v1';let revision=0,saving=false,typeFilter='',legacyData=null;let db,seed,view='inventory',query='',statusFilter='',criticalFilter='',sourceFilter='',page=1,allFields=false,room='Salle IT 1',rackQuery='',lastFocus,toastTimer,importDraft;
let currentRole='reader',currentUser=null,qualityFilter='';
const adminActions=new Set(['add-host','edit-record','add-record','add-rack','add-room','edit-rack','placement','rack-assign','remove-record','remove-placement','confirm-remove','app-add','app-edit','app-delete','app-delete-confirm','delete-host','delete-host-confirm','delete-rack','delete-rack-confirm','legacy','legacy-import','backup','restore','import','apply-import','template','history']);
const adminPage=/^\/admin\/?$/.test(location.pathname);
const canAdmin=()=>adminPage&&currentRole==='admin';
const PAGE_SIZE=20;
const hostById=id=>db.hosts.find(h=>h.id===id), rackById=id=>db.racks.find(r=>r.id===id), primary=h=>h.records[0]||{};
const missing=v=>!v||['na','n/a','n.a','-','none'].includes(String(v).trim().toLowerCase());
const pill=v=>`<span class="pill ${esc(String(v||'Unknown').toLowerCase().replace(/\s/g,'-'))}">${esc(v||'Unknown')}</span>`;
const roomDisplay=name=>{const m=String(name||'').match(/^Salle IT\s*(\d+)$/i);return m?`Computer Room ${m[1]}`:name};
const roomNames=()=>{const names=[...new Set([...(db.rooms||[]),...db.racks.map(r=>r.room)])];return names.length?names:['Computer Room 1','Computer Room 2']};
const btn=(label,action,id='',style='',ico='')=>(adminActions.has(action)&&!canAdmin())?'':`<button class="btn ${style}" data-action="${action}" data-id="${esc(id)}">${ico?icon(ico):''}${label}</button>`;
function toast(msg){$('#toast').textContent=msg;$('#toast').classList.add('show');clearTimeout(toastTimer);toastTimer=setTimeout(()=>$('#toast').classList.remove('show'),4200)}
async function persist(message,action,object,endpoint='/api/admin/workspace'){
  if(!canAdmin()){toast('Read-only access.');return false}
  if(saving){toast('A save is already in progress.');return false}
  saving=true;document.body.classList.add('saving');
  $('#saveState').innerHTML='<span class="dot"></span>Saving to database…';
  try{
    CmdbModel.validate(db);
    const response=await fetch(endpoint,{method:'PUT',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({state:db,revision,change:{action,object}})});
    const result=await response.json();
    if(!response.ok){if(response.status===401||response.status===403){lockAdmin();await enterAdmin()}throw Error(result.error||'The database could not save this change.');}
    revision=result.revision;db.audit=result.audit;
    $('#saveState').innerHTML='<span class="dot"></span>Saved to database';
    if(message)toast(message);return true;
  }catch(error){
    $('#saveState').textContent='Not saved — reload if data changed';
    const errorBox=$('#formError')||$('#importError');if(errorBox)errorBox.textContent=error.message;
    toast(error.message);return false;
  }finally{saving=false;document.body.classList.remove('saving')}
}
async function transact(mutator,message,action,object){
  if(!canAdmin()){toast('Read-only access.');return false}
  if(saving){toast('Please wait for the current save.');return false}
  const old=structuredClone(db);
  try{mutator()}catch(error){db=old;toast(error.message);return false}
  if(!await persist(message,action,object)){db=old;return false}return true;
}

function hostLink(h){return `<button class="link-button" data-action="host" data-id="${esc(h.id)}">${esc(h.server)}</button>`}
function placementList(rid){return db.hosts.flatMap(h=>h.placements.filter(p=>p.rackId===rid).map(p=>({h,p})))}
function rackStats(r){const list=placementList(r.id),used=new Set();list.forEach(({p})=>{for(let u=p.unit;u<p.unit+p.height;u++)if(u>0&&u<=r.units)used.add(u)});return {list,used,count:new Set(list.map(x=>x.h.id)).size,pct:Math.round(used.size/r.units*100)}}
function counts(){return {total:db.hosts.length,prod:db.hosts.filter(h=>h.records.some(r=>r.status.toLowerCase()==='prod')).length,high:db.hosts.filter(h=>h.records.some(r=>/^(very )?high$/i.test(r.criticality))).length,records:db.hosts.reduce((n,h)=>n+h.records.length,0)}}
function filtered(){const q=query.toLowerCase().trim();return db.hosts.filter(h=>(!q||[h.server,...h.records.flatMap(r=>fields.map(([k])=>r[k])),...h.placements.map(p=>{const r=rackById(p.rackId);return r?`${r.name} ${r.room}`:''})].join(' ').toLowerCase().includes(q))&&(!qualityFilter||qualityMatches(h,qualityFilter))&&(!typeFilter||h.type===typeFilter)&&(!statusFilter||h.records.some(r=>r.status.toLowerCase()===statusFilter.toLowerCase()))&&(!criticalFilter||h.records.some(r=>criticalFilter==='High + Very High'?/^(very )?high$/i.test(r.criticality):r.criticality===criticalFilter)))}
function heading(title,description,eyebrow,actions){$('#pageTitle').textContent=title;$('#breadcrumb').textContent=title;$('#pageDescription').textContent=description;$('#eyebrow').textContent=eyebrow;$('#pageActions').innerHTML=actions}
function navigate(){view=location.hash.slice(1).split('/')[0]||(adminPage?'admin':'inventory');if(!['inventory','room','racks','applications','admin'].includes(view))view='inventory';if(view==='admin'&&!canAdmin())view='inventory';$$('[data-nav]').forEach(a=>{a.classList.toggle('active',a.dataset.nav===view);if(a.dataset.nav===view)a.setAttribute('aria-current','page');else a.removeAttribute('aria-current')});$('#navCount').textContent=db.hosts.length.toLocaleString();render()}
function render(){if(view==='inventory')renderInventory();else if(view==='room')renderRoom();else if(view==='racks')renderRacks();else if(view==='applications')renderApplications();else renderAdministration();icons();if(legacyData&&canAdmin())showLegacyBanner()}
function options(values,current,first){return `<option value="">${first}</option>`+values.map(v=>`<option value="${esc(v)}"${v===current?' selected':''}>${esc(v)}</option>`).join('')}
function renderInventory(){const c=counts();heading('CMDB inventory','One place for your servers, applications, and physical infrastructure.','INFRASTRUCTURE OVERVIEW',btn('Applications','applications','','','layers')+btn('Import CSV','import','','','upload')+btn('Add host','add-host','','primary','plus'));if(qualityFilter)$('#pageDescription').textContent='Data quality: '+qualityLabels[qualityFilter]+'. Clear filters to return to all hosts.';
 $('#content').innerHTML=`<div class="stats">${[['Hosts & devices',c.total,'CMDB hosts and layout devices','server','all'],['Production hosts',c.prod,'Hosts with a production record','activity','prod'],['High criticality',c.high,'High and very high priority hosts','shield','high'],['Computer room racks',db.racks.length,'Across computer rooms','layout','racks']].map(([label,n,sub,ic,act])=>`<button class="stat" data-action="stat" data-id="${act}"><span class="stat-icon">${icon(ic)}</span><div class="stat-label">${label}</div><div class="stat-value">${n.toLocaleString()}</div><small>${sub}</small></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="source-banner">${icon('info')}<span><strong>Operational CMDB inventory.</strong> Browse ${c.records.toLocaleString()} application records, host relationships, rack placements, and documented infrastructure ownership from the shared database.</span><button class="link-button" data-action="help">About inventory ${icon('chevron')}</button></div><section class="panel" aria-label="Host inventory"><div class="panel-title"><div><h2>Host inventory <span class="count-chip" id="resultCount"></span></h2><p>Select any host to explore its complete information.</p></div><div class="actions">${btn('History','history','','','clock')}${btn('Export CSV','export','','','download')}</div></div><div class="filterbar"><label class="searchbox">${icon('search')}<input id="hostSearch" value="${esc(query)}" placeholder="Search host, application, owner, rack…" aria-label="Search inventory"></label><select id="typeFilter" aria-label="Filter host type">${options(['physical','virtual','unclassified'],typeFilter,'All host types')}</select><select id="statusFilter" aria-label="Filter status">${options([...new Set(db.hosts.flatMap(h=>h.records.map(r=>r.status)).filter(Boolean))].sort(),statusFilter,'All statuses')}</select><select id="criticalFilter" aria-label="Filter criticality">${options(['High + Very High','Very High','High','Medium','Low'],criticalFilter,'All criticalities')}</select><button class="icon-button" data-action="clear-filters" title="Clear filters" aria-label="Clear filters">${icon('x')}</button><label class="check-label"><input type="checkbox" id="allFields" ${allFields?'checked':''}>All 16 fields</label></div><div id="inventoryTable"></div></section><div class="context-row"><span class="subtle">Multiple application records stay linked to their host for clear ownership, availability, and application context.</span>${btn('Open computer rooms','go-room','','','arrow')}</div>`;
 if(!canAdmin())$('.source-banner')?.remove();
 updateTable();$('#hostSearch').oninput=e=>{query=e.target.value;page=1;updateTable()};for(const [id,setter] of [['typeFilter',v=>typeFilter=v],['statusFilter',v=>statusFilter=v],['criticalFilter',v=>criticalFilter=v]])$('#'+id).onchange=e=>{setter(e.target.value);page=1;updateTable()};$('#allFields').onchange=e=>{allFields=e.target.checked;page=1;updateTable()}}
function updateTable(){const list=filtered();page=Math.max(1,Math.min(page,Math.ceil(list.length/PAGE_SIZE)||1));const shown=list.slice((page-1)*PAGE_SIZE,page*PAGE_SIZE);$('#resultCount').textContent=list.length.toLocaleString();
 const cols=allFields?fields.map(([,v])=>v):['Host / device','Type','Application','Status','Criticality','Infra Owner','Location',''];
 const rows=allFields?shown.flatMap(h=>(h.records.length?h.records:[{server:h.server}]).map(r=>`<tr>${fields.map(([k])=>`<td>${k==='server'?hostLink(h):esc(r[k]||'—')}</td>`).join('')}</tr>`)):shown.map(h=>{const r=primary(h),p=h.placements[0],rack=p&&rackById(p.rackId);return `<tr><td><div class="host-name"><span class="host-mark">${icon('server')}</span><div>${hostLink(h)}<small>${h.type==='virtual'?'VMware · '+esc(h.vmware.cluster||'Cluster not set'):h.records.length?`${h.records.length} application record${h.records.length>1?'s':''}`:'Layout device · CMDB unavailable'}</small></div></div></td><td>${pill(typeLabel(h.type))}</td><td><span class="clip" title="${esc(r.application)}">${esc(r.application||'Not documented')}</span>${h.records.length>1?`<span class="subtle">+ ${h.records.length-1} linked record${h.records.length>2?'s':''}</span>`:''}</td><td>${pill(r.status||'Unknown')}</td><td>${pill(r.criticality||'Unknown')}</td><td>${esc(r.owner||'—')}</td><td>${rack?`<button class="link-button" data-action="rack" data-id="${esc(rack.id)}">${esc(rack.name)} · U${p.unit}</button><small class="subtle" style="display:block">${esc(rack.room)}</small>`:`<span class="unassigned">${missing(r.location)?'Unassigned':esc(r.location)}</span>`}</td><td><button class="icon-button" data-action="host" data-id="${esc(h.id)}" aria-label="View ${esc(h.server)}">${icon('chevron')}</button></td></tr>`});
 $('#inventoryTable').innerHTML=list.length?`<div class="table-wrap"><table class="${allFields?'all-fields':''}"><thead><tr>${cols.map(c=>`<th>${esc(c)}</th>`).join('')}</tr></thead><tbody>${rows.join('')}</tbody></table></div><div class="pagination"><span>${(page-1)*PAGE_SIZE+1}–${Math.min(page*PAGE_SIZE,list.length)} of ${list.length.toLocaleString()} hosts</span><div class="actions"><button class="btn" data-action="prev" ${page===1?'disabled':''}>Previous</button><span>${page} / ${Math.ceil(list.length/PAGE_SIZE)}</span><button class="btn" data-action="next" ${page*PAGE_SIZE>=list.length?'disabled':''}>Next</button></div></div>`:`<div class="empty">${icon('search')}<h3>No matching hosts</h3><p>Try a different search or clear your filters.</p><br>${btn('Clear filters','clear-filters')}</div>`}
function roomTabs(){return `<div class="room-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Select computer room">${roomNames().map(r=>`<button class="${r===room?'active':''}" data-action="room-select" data-id="${esc(r)}" aria-pressed="${r===room}">${esc(roomDisplay(r))}</button>`).join('')}</div>`}
function renderRoom(){heading('Computer rooms','A clear view of your physical infrastructure. Select a rack to explore inside.','FROM ROOM TO RACK TO HOST',btn('Rack inventory','go-racks','','','server')+btn('Add computer room','add-room','','primary','plus'));const racks=db.racks.filter(r=>r.room===room);$('#content').innerHTML=roomTabs()+`<div class="source-banner">${icon('info')}<span><strong>Computer room inventory.</strong> Rack names, aisle groups, and mapped equipment are maintained in the CMDB. Verify physical availability before changes.</span></div><div class="room-map"><div class="room-map-title"><span>${esc(roomDisplay(room).toUpperCase())} · ROOM PLAN</span><span>${racks.length} RACKS · SELECT TO INSPECT</span></div>${[...new Set(racks.map(r=>r.aisle))].map(a=>`<div class="aisle-label">${esc(a)}</div><div class="rack-grid">${racks.filter(r=>r.aisle===a).map(r=>{const s=rackStats(r);return `<button class="rack-tile" data-action="rack" data-id="${esc(r.id)}" aria-label="Open ${esc(r.name)}, ${esc(r.aisle)}, ${s.count} devices"><strong>${esc(r.name)}</strong><span class="rack-arrow">${icon('arrow')}</span><small>${r.units}U cabinet</small><div class="rack-mini">${Array.from({length:30},(_,i)=>`<span class="${i<Math.round(s.pct*.3)?'occupied':''}"></span>`).join('')}</div><div class="capacity"><span>${s.count} devices</span><span>${s.used.size}U mapped</span></div></button>`}).join('')}</div>`).join('')}<div class="legend"><span><i></i>Mapped equipment</span><span><i class="empty-unit"></i>Unmapped units</span><span>Blank rack units are not confirmed available space.</span></div></div><div class="room-summary"><div><span>RACKS IN THIS ROOM</span><strong>${racks.length}</strong></div><div><span>MAPPED DEVICE POSITIONS</span><strong>${racks.reduce((n,r)=>n+rackStats(r).list.length,0)}</strong></div><div><span>DOCUMENTED RACK UNITS</span><strong>${racks.reduce((n,r)=>n+rackStats(r).used.size,0)} <span>/ ${racks.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.units,0)}U</span></strong></div></div>`}
function renderRacks(){heading('Rack inventory','Browse cabinets and inspect their equipment and physical placements.','PHYSICAL INFRASTRUCTURE',btn('Add rack','add-rack','','primary','plus'));const rs=db.racks.filter(r=>r.room===room&&`${r.name} ${r.aisle}`.toLowerCase().includes(rackQuery.toLowerCase()));$('#content').innerHTML=roomTabs()+`<div class="filterbar" style="padding:0 0 20px"><label class="searchbox">${icon('search')}<input id="rackSearch" value="${esc(rackQuery)}" placeholder="Find a rack or aisle…" aria-label="Search racks"></label><span class="subtle">${rs.length} cabinets in ${esc(roomDisplay(room))}</span></div><div class="rack-list-grid">${rs.map(r=>{const s=rackStats(r);return `<article class="rack-card"><header><h3>${esc(r.name)}</h3></header><p>${esc(roomDisplay(r.room))} <span> / </span> ${esc(r.aisle)} · ${r.units}U</p><div class="capacity"><span>${s.count} devices · ${s.used.size}U mapped</span><span>${s.pct}%</span></div><div class="bar"><div style="width:${s.pct}%"></div></div><p style="margin-top:12px">${esc(r.rj45||'—')} RJ45 · ${esc(r.fibre||'—')} fibre ports</p>${btn('Open rack & equipment','rack',r.id,'','arrow')}</article>`}).join('')||'<div class="empty">No racks match this search.</div>'}</div>`;$('#rackSearch').oninput=e=>{rackQuery=e.target.value;const p=e.target.selectionStart;renderRacks();$('#rackSearch').focus();$('#rackSearch').setSelectionRange(p,p)}}
function modal(title,body,footer='',eyebrow='INFRASTRUCTURE DETAILS'){const d=$('#dialog');if(!d.open)lastFocus=document.activeElement;$('#dialogContent').innerHTML=`<div class="modal-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">${eyebrow}</div><h2 id="dialogTitle">${esc(title)}</h2></div><button class="icon-button" data-action="close" aria-label="Close dialog">${icon('x')}</button></div><div class="modal-body">${body}</div>${footer?`<div class="modal-footer">${footer}</div>`:''}`;if(!d.open)d.showModal();d.scrollTop=0;d.querySelector('[data-action="close"]').focus()}
